type: software
title: "CrowdSense: Real-Time Crowd Density Estimation and Monitoring with Multifaceted Attention"
abstract: >-
  AI-powered crowd monitoring system that estimates crowd counts and density maps with a
  Multifaceted Attention Network adapted to Arab-context scenes, served through a FastAPI
  backend and a web dashboard. B.Sc. senior project, Imam Abdulrahman Bin Faisal University.
